	(descr "microSD socket, push-push, right-angle SMD, Korean Hroparts Elec TF-01A (LCSC C91145; also fits the same-size TF-115-type sockets: XUNPU TF-115, SHOU HAN TF PUSH, XKB XKTF-015-N, SOFNG TF-015). Land pattern from the HRO drawing (2023-08-20, docs/references/sd/). Origin between the two locating holes; the card comes out towards +y. Body front at y 4.00 (right part; 3.30 on the left). Card end from the body front: pushed in 1.32, locked 2.50, popped out 5.60. Pin 9 (CD) closes to the shell when a card is in")
